  79:     Rule
  80:     Find that object, crop its bounding box, and replace each background gap component with the color of the separate marker component or components having the same normalized shape.
  81:     Key insight
  82:     The marker objects do not mark absolute positions; their shapes identify which gaps in the selected object should be colored, while objects with unmatched gaps are distractors.
